    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91271" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτωκάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτώξ, πτώσσω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>timorous</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτωκάσιν αἰθυίῃσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hom.
					<u>Epigr.</u>
					8.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κύπειρος</span>
			<i>crouching, low</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simm.
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> pl. as
				Subst., <i>timorous ones</i>, i.e. <i>birds</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1093
			</span></i> (lyr., dub.l.).</div>
